(40, '3e9bcbc15dd29aeec5b807493a4b7867', 'assistant', 'According to the data, there are:\n\n- 16 orders that are delivered (₹2,849.00)\n- 8 orders that are confirmed (₹1,805.50)\n- 2 orders that are shipped (₹331.00)\n\nNote that the data does not explicitly mention \"paid\" orders, but it can be inferred that delivered, confirmed, and shipped orders are likely paid. However, to get the exact number of paid orders, more information would be needed.', NULL, '2026-04-27 04:48:20'),
(41, '3e9bcbc15dd29aeec5b807493a4b7867', 'user', 'what is the expense', NULL, '2026-04-27 04:48:35'),
(42, '3e9bcbc15dd29aeec5b807493a4b7867', 'assistant', 'The total expenses are not explicitly mentioned, but the expenses by category are:\n\n- Rent: ₹90,000.00\n- Salary: ₹86,000.00\n- Raw Materials - Wood Powder: ₹67,000.00\n- Maintenance Spares: ₹40,200.00\n- Employee Welfare: ₹25,700.00\n- Raw Materials - Corn Cob: ₹18,700.00\n- Raw Materials - Cotton Stalk: ₹15,400.00\n- Raw Materials - Nappier Grass: ₹9,800.00\n- Office Stationery: ₹3,450.00\n- Equipment Purchase: ₹1,000.00\n\nTo find the total expense, you would need to add up these individual expenses. \n\nTotal expense = ₹90,000 + ₹86,000 + ₹67,000 + ₹40,200 + ₹25,700 + ₹18,700 + ₹15,400 + ₹9,800 + ₹3,450 + ₹1,000 \nTotal expense = ₹357,250', NULL, '2026-04-27 04:48:35'),
(43, '54a46d5b25192b07c586360aa724c24e', 'user', 'What are my total expenses', NULL, '2026-04-27 04:48:40'),
(44, '54a46d5b25192b07c586360aa724c24e', 'assistant', 'To calculate the total expenses, we need to sum up all the expenses by category. \n\nTotal expenses = \nRent: ₹90,000.00 + \nSalary: ₹86,000.00 + \nRaw Materials - Wood Powder: ₹67,000.00 + \nMaintenance Spares: ₹40,200.00 + \nEmployee Welfare: ₹25,700.00 + \nRaw Materials - Corn Cob: ₹18,700.00 + \nRaw Materials - Cotton Stalk: ₹15,400.00 + \nRaw Materials - Nappier Grass: ₹9,800.00 + \nOffice Stationery: ₹3,450.00 + \nEquipment Purchase: ₹1,000.00\n\nTotal expenses = ₹90,000 + ₹86,000 + ₹67,000 + ₹40,200 + ₹25,700 + ₹18,700 + ₹15,400 + ₹9,800 + ₹3,450 + ₹1,000 \nTotal expenses = ₹357,250.00', NULL, '2026-04-27 04:48:40'),
